Package: pca3D
Title: Rotating 3D-Style PCA Plots with ggplot2
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Pascal", "Noser", , "pascalnoser@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create 3D-style PCA scatter plots from 'prcomp' objects using
    'ggplot2', including static views and rotating GIF animations of a full
    360 degree spin. Supports colouring by continuous or categorical sample
    metadata, choice of principal component dimensions, and annotation of
    variance explained.
